+| Read | GET | `/reports` | Module/branch/combined finance reports |
+| Read | GET | `/ledger` | Scoped journal history |
+| Read | GET | `/audit` | Owner audit history |
+| Read | GET | `/rentals/availability` | Available rental fleet for a date interval |
